,"venueID":"osm-w23216348","start":"2026-11-18T23:00:00Z","end":"2026-12-31T22:59:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"de Bénédicte PHILIPPON, Livête CAPUCHE et A.R. CHÈRE Quand les riches deviennent de plus en plus riches et les pauvres de plus en plus pauvres, il est temps que Robin des Bois rende la justice. C’est Othmane Moumen qui incarnera le héros redresseur de tort. Entouré d’une joyeuse troupe, il nous entraîne dans une fable vive et engagée, véritable écho à l’état du monde d’aujourd’hui. Une aventure pleine d’élan et de panache. Avec Félix BAREL, Romane BERLANGER, Julien BESURE, Ariel BWABO, Vladimir BURRION, Mathilde DAFFE, Laurie DEGAND, Émilie GUILLAUME, Elliott GUYOT, Thierry JANSSEN, Lucien LARIVIÈRE, Othmane MOUMEN, Guy PION, Gustave RENDERS, Jean-François ROSSION, Jérôme VILAIN, Jules WEISS Mise en […]","people":[],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":null,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Teatro_Real_del_Parque%2C_Bruselas%2C_B%C3%A9lgica%2C_2021-12-15%2C_DD_53.jpg/960px-Teatro_Real_del_Parque%2C_Bruselas%2C_B%C3%A9lgica%2C_2021-12-15%2C_DD_53.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://visit.brussels/fr/visiteurs/agenda/event-detail.593374","sourceName":"agenda.brussels","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"bxl-5700027893","title":"The Logic of Place : Shawanda Corbett, Pam Glick, Naotaka Hiro, Emily Kraus, Brie Ruais","category":"art","venueID":"osm-n6780405149","start":"2026-11-18T23:00:00Z","end":"2027-01-09T22:59:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"","people":[],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":null,"imageURL":"https://agendabrussels2.imgix.net/2a43507aea95342706b1e61553046436b4fd6685.png","sourceURL":"https://visit.brussels/fr/visiteurs/agenda/event-detail.5700027893","sourceName":"agenda.brussels","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft